{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"4724","name":"溢神的论证","desc":"3.0版本活动 溢神的论证","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/07/4521515/cff12ed5ccd894491cf17ac44ac48dc8_3274426599307811790.jpg","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"溢神的论证","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/07/4521515/44b5696c34f590e47b60278452214fbe_3364250167084474558.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1311","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e活动期间，旅行者可在战斗挑战中通过使用溢神剂进入「时停超感」状态，捕捉敌人露出的破绽，帮助须弥学者完成课题，即可获取\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e原石、大英雄的经验、角色培养素材、武器突破素材、精锻用魔矿、摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e2022/09/08 10:00 ~ 2022/09/26 03:59\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥20级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e且完成魔神任务：序章·第三幕「巨龙与自由之歌」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(51,51,51,1)\\\"\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 活动开启后的前七天，每天解锁1个新的战斗关卡，共7关。 \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 在战斗挑战中，溢神剂量会随时间回复，旅行者也可通过击杀敌人获得更多溢神剂量，使用溢神剂进入「时停超感」状态并利用取景框捕捉敌方的破绽，「时停超感」状态结束后即会恢复战斗，同时释放「超感技能」帮助旅行者更快地完成挑战。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e● 合理利用超感技能击杀怪物以获得更多积分，达成挑战目标后，即可获得\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e原石、大英雄的经验、角色培养素材、武器突破素材、精锻用魔矿、摩拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(73,73,73,1)\\\"\u003e● 战斗关卡中只能使用给定的试用角色，\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\\\"\u003e也无法产生元素共鸣。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1312","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动流程","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e玩法教学\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/12/4521515/3fa530381bf216bf324390f1d7a806e3_1352878444186554130.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:450px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/12/4521515/fbe9f35334f3a203cda455605f4c2ffd_1746056590180057664.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:450px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/12/4521515/5f9f7491d1531737b7216221557f84e8_345569569492400809.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:450px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e关卡一：伞盖菌褶的漏洞\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e众所周知，防御有两种方式，一是生长防御结构，二是假以坚固之物。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/09/12/4521515/916c2271486bc1c58f77c0f1ccdc9334_4850624260633195831.jpg\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"width:450px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e奖励